      "text": {
        "jp": "……エルとルルカが守ってくれたものです。\r\nこれ以上、六盟傑の好きにはさせません。",
        "official_en": "El and Luka sacrificed everything to defend Olderion’s waters. I shall not let the Sworn Six prevail any longer.",
        "real_en": "...El and Ruruka protected that water. I won't let the Sworn Six do whatever they want anymore."
      },
