      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここまですべてのクリスタルが\r\n六盟傑に破壊されている。",
        "official_en": "The Sworn Six has thus far been successful in shattering the Crystals.",
        "real_en": "So far, the Sworn Six have destroyed every Crystal."
