        "official_en_sha256": "a466ec984498201f434ccad5063a9513a1c2b23e3a3df5d8c381b968b0910522"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この国のことはまだわからない。\r\n今はもう少し様子を見た方がよさそうだ。",
        "official_en": "We still don’t know much about this land. We’re better off monitoring the situation a little more.",
