        "official_en_sha256": "4f60b6955f16d7459adeecf2b85fa6b47f15f15971b402a03b6db495194b03ca"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この集団ではどうあがいても目立ちますね……。\r\n仕方ありません。\r\n手分けして情報を集めましょう。",
        "official_en": "We’re practically begging for attention in our current assemblage. It’s not ideal, but we should split up and then find the information we need.",
        "real_en": "This group will stand out no matter what we do... It can't be helped. Let's split up and gather information."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
