    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_410_01:410_01_011:e623f055",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C04_410_01",
        "key": "410_01_011",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_410_01:410_01_011:e623f055",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_410_01:410_01_011:e623f055",
        "jp_sha256": "ba5e6a9812ee552b6c540fe85eaa31f23d4e38a58a7ec38d0e38f872442da9e2",
        "official_en_sha256": "4e5111634c5134df6e200819181c636f41387f5480c9b53f75ae3547825d965e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうよ、町中を電車が走っているの。\r\nゾルダードは広いから、\r\nそれに乗って移動するのがいいわ。",
        "official_en": "Yup, they’ve got tracks all over the city. Zoldaad’s huge, so riding these’ll sure as heck beat hoofing it around.",
        "real_en": "That's right. Trains run all through the city. Zoldaad is huge, so it's best to use them to get around."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
